      "content": "i know, i know, but my doctor is super hard to get a hold of and i'm really struggling to breathe through my nose right now. i just want to know if a normal dose of the 60mg one is gonna cause an immediate problem or if it's basically fine since i'm already on my lisinopril to keep it under control. like, is it really that risky to just take one dose?",
